        "original_id": "f6ea17b5-ee5a-5721-a99a-5da240be7b2a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Blake LeVine, Brad Pitt, Princess Diana, Mother Teresa, Frank Sinatra, Maury Povich, Jon Stewart\n- Media Organizations: Entertainment Tonight, The Jon Stewart Show, CNN, The New York Post, Premiere Magazine, Los Angeles Times\n- Topics: Celebrity autograph collecting, media appearances\n\nFacts:\n- As a child, Blake LeVine was featured on Entertainment Tonight, Maury Povich, The Jon Stewart Show, CNN, The New York Post, Premiere Magazine, The Los Angeles Times, and numerous radio programs.\n- Blake LeVine was featured for his experiences collecting autographs from celebrities including Princess Diana, Mother Teresa, Brad Pitt, Frank Sinatra, and more than 1,000 notable people.\n- Brad Pitt was born on December 18, 1963.\n- Brad Pitt’s full name is William Bradley Pitt.\n- Brad Pitt is an American actor and producer.",
